WEBVTT

00:32.240 --> 00:35.720
People often say that our bodies

00:35.800 --> 00:37.640
belong to us.

00:39.680 --> 00:41.760
My body, my choice.

00:41.840 --> 00:44.320
My body, my choice.

00:44.400 --> 00:46.560
We can do whatever we want with it.

01:07.640 --> 01:09.360
-THE ROOM LOOKS VERY INVITING
-YOU LOOK BEAUTIFUL IN ANY OUTFIT

01:09.440 --> 01:11.320
-YOU MUST SMELL REALLY NICE
-LET ME SMELL YOU

01:11.400 --> 01:13.280
-YOUR PAJAMAS LOOK SO TOUCHABLE
-WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BRA?

01:13.360 --> 01:15.440
You want to see my bra?

01:17.120 --> 01:19.480
My body, my choice.

01:20.520 --> 01:21.680
Everyone,

01:21.760 --> 01:25.080
these are pajamas.
Who even wears a bra with pajamas?

01:25.840 --> 01:27.800
I'm braless right now.

01:28.680 --> 01:29.920
Don't believe it?

01:37.720 --> 01:39.360
-Blossom.
-Wow, so pretty.

01:39.440 --> 01:42.040
My body, my choice.

01:42.120 --> 01:46.400
So, my body, my choice?

01:47.120 --> 01:49.200
Is that really true, Blossom?

03:22.840 --> 03:24.000
Do you realize

03:24.520 --> 03:27.000
that you're spreading
the wrong idea to other people?

03:28.960 --> 03:32.360
And what you're doing isn't right either.

03:34.160 --> 03:38.160
Besides, it disgraces the school.

03:39.000 --> 03:41.280
And it will affect your future as well.

03:43.320 --> 03:45.720
Um, what did I do wrong, Teacher?

03:47.040 --> 03:48.440
You still don't realize it?

03:49.120 --> 03:50.640
All of this.

03:52.120 --> 03:53.240
Teacher,

03:54.040 --> 03:57.440
what I said
is something the world should know.

03:57.520 --> 04:00.240
I inspire many women

04:00.320 --> 04:03.840
to stand up and be themselves,
to do what they want to do.

04:03.920 --> 04:06.240
You're damaging the school's reputation.

04:09.960 --> 04:12.480
But I never said which school I study at.

04:13.000 --> 04:16.280
And if you're saying it damages me,

04:17.120 --> 04:20.520
I don't see how I'm damaged at all.

04:21.200 --> 04:22.800
Everyone seems to like it.

04:25.920 --> 04:27.720
Let me tell you something, Teacher.

04:28.840 --> 04:30.600
It's my body.

04:31.120 --> 04:33.920
What I do with it, where I show it,

04:34.440 --> 04:35.640
who I show it to,

04:37.280 --> 04:38.600
that's my business.

04:52.640 --> 04:56.320
You're the one
who needs to give yourself some freedom.

04:56.840 --> 05:00.960
I believe you could be
a sexy headmaster too.

05:03.040 --> 05:06.840
But first,
why don't you try unbuttoning a button?

05:48.080 --> 05:49.680
Hello, Blossom.

05:52.480 --> 05:54.840
I'm Nanno. I'm a new student here.

05:56.240 --> 05:57.360
Hello.

05:58.760 --> 06:02.320
You're amazing, Blossom.
You've managed to get people so hyped up.

06:02.920 --> 06:05.080
Even the headmaster
can't do anything to you.

06:07.120 --> 06:08.720
I'm just speaking the truth.

06:08.800 --> 06:12.200
I created my channel to empower women,

06:12.280 --> 06:14.320
so they can stand up
and do what they want.

06:14.920 --> 06:16.880
Nanno, you can subscribe if you want.

06:16.960 --> 06:18.480
I'll make you a special fan.

06:19.080 --> 06:20.640
I subscribed a long time ago.

06:20.720 --> 06:23.040
There are many clips I like.

06:23.120 --> 06:26.080
You inspire me in many ways.

06:26.640 --> 06:28.760
Really? That makes me so happy.

06:28.840 --> 06:31.720
Can you tell me what I inspire you to do?

06:31.800 --> 06:34.960
Um, well…

06:36.280 --> 06:38.520
I used to be too shy to wear short skirts.

06:38.600 --> 06:40.240
But now I'm not anymore.

06:43.440 --> 06:44.360
That's great.

06:45.760 --> 06:47.040
And…

06:48.080 --> 06:50.400
I had never dared
to start a channel like yours.

06:51.000 --> 06:52.440
But now I have.

07:05.760 --> 07:07.000
This is my channel.

07:08.520 --> 07:10.440
You should know, Blossom,

07:10.520 --> 07:13.480
because of you,
I finally dared to start my own channel.

07:49.400 --> 07:52.320
Hello, everyone. I'm Nanno.

07:52.400 --> 07:54.960
-HELLO, PRETTY
-HELLO

07:55.040 --> 07:57.240
-HELLO
-SO PRETTY

07:57.320 --> 07:59.280
It's so hot today.

08:00.760 --> 08:02.560
What should we do?

08:02.640 --> 08:04.400
UNBUTTON YOUR SHIRT

08:04.480 --> 08:06.240
You want me to unbutton my shirt?

08:07.600 --> 08:09.760
How many buttons should I undo?

08:09.840 --> 08:10.720
THREE

08:10.800 --> 08:12.120
TWO IS FINE. I'M WAITING.

08:12.200 --> 08:13.680
TAKE IT OFF

08:16.160 --> 08:17.600
One?

08:18.200 --> 08:19.640
Two?

08:20.360 --> 08:21.800
Or…

08:22.320 --> 08:23.720
three?

08:23.800 --> 08:25.160
CAN YOU DO THREE?

08:25.240 --> 08:26.920
YOU CAN DO THREE

08:27.000 --> 08:28.520
THAT'S RIGHT, NANNO

08:40.720 --> 08:41.920
THIS IS "MY BODY, MY CHOICE"

08:42.000 --> 08:43.000
HOTTER THAN BLOSSOM

08:43.080 --> 08:44.560
How about this?

08:44.640 --> 08:45.920
I LOVE IT

09:03.560 --> 09:05.200
-She's so cute.
-Yeah.

09:17.400 --> 09:19.320
Nanno, can we take a photo with you?

09:19.400 --> 09:20.240
Sure.

09:20.320 --> 09:23.000
Take one of me. Make me look cool.

09:23.600 --> 09:25.200
Enough. My turn.

09:25.720 --> 09:27.560
One more. One, two.

09:27.640 --> 09:28.640
Thank you.

09:28.720 --> 09:31.240
-Let's go.
-She's so cute.

09:31.320 --> 09:33.800
I'm so shy.

09:45.440 --> 09:46.560
Blossom.

09:49.120 --> 09:51.520
Last night, when I followed your example,

09:51.600 --> 09:54.040
so many people signed up to be my fans.

09:55.920 --> 09:57.400
You mean subscribers?

09:59.720 --> 10:00.960
I mean real fans.

10:01.560 --> 10:02.480
Look.

10:06.960 --> 10:08.400
I think

10:08.920 --> 10:10.160
the idea that

10:10.720 --> 10:13.680
our bodies belong to us

10:14.440 --> 10:16.200
is amazing.

10:20.440 --> 10:23.560
Anyway, I should go now.

10:24.560 --> 10:25.600
Bye.

10:50.000 --> 10:50.840
This is for me?

11:07.480 --> 11:09.000
YOU CAN UNBUTTON FOUR

11:20.480 --> 11:21.800
Thank you so much, Blossom.

11:23.040 --> 11:25.400
At first, I didn't think
you'd realize your mistake.

11:26.400 --> 11:27.640
But in the end,

11:28.600 --> 11:30.440
I'm glad you came to your senses.

11:32.200 --> 11:33.640
Now I've realized

11:34.160 --> 11:37.120
what should and shouldn't be done.

11:44.320 --> 11:45.760
Goodbye, Teacher.

11:48.560 --> 11:51.160
What you did wasn't right.

11:51.880 --> 11:55.360
I've been in this school for years
and never seen anything like this.

11:56.600 --> 11:59.120
I had to do this because it damages
the reputation of our school.

12:00.000 --> 12:01.120
Think about that.

12:01.640 --> 12:04.040
Don't make me deduct points
from your conduct score.

12:07.720 --> 12:09.080
Everyone,

12:10.440 --> 12:13.160
today I would like
to sincerely apologize.

12:14.560 --> 12:16.920
I might not be able
to live stream like before anymore.

12:17.000 --> 12:17.880
WHY? WHAT HAPPENED?

12:17.960 --> 12:20.080
I may have to close my channel

12:20.160 --> 12:22.280
to avoid damaging the school's reputation.

12:22.360 --> 12:23.200
DON'T

12:23.280 --> 12:24.800
DON'T CLOSE IT. I'LL PROTECT YOU.

12:24.880 --> 12:26.560
WHO DID THIS TO YOU? FIGHT ME.

12:26.640 --> 12:28.000
I know.

12:28.520 --> 12:31.440
But everything should have limits, right?

12:32.320 --> 12:33.520
Or maybe

12:34.600 --> 12:38.280
our bodies
don't actually belong to us after all.

12:38.360 --> 12:39.720
DON'T CLOSE THE CHANNEL

12:39.800 --> 12:41.560
OUR BODIES MUST BELONG TO US

12:41.640 --> 12:44.240
SUEA: I'LL MAKE SURE YOUR BODY
BELONGS TO YOU, NANNO

12:44.320 --> 12:46.120
SUEA: IT CAN'T BELONG TO ANYONE ELSE

12:46.200 --> 12:47.680
SAVE NANNO

12:47.760 --> 12:50.360
NO ONE CAN TAKE AWAY NANNO

12:50.440 --> 12:51.600
I LOVE NANNO'S BODY

12:55.560 --> 12:57.760
What are you doing?
You can't leave that there.

12:58.720 --> 13:00.480
I'm delivering it to the headmaster.

13:00.560 --> 13:03.760
Did you inform anyone?
You can't leave it here. You can't.

13:03.840 --> 13:04.960
What's going on?

13:05.480 --> 13:08.000
-Huh?
-He said it's a delivery for you.

13:08.080 --> 13:08.920
What is it?

13:12.200 --> 13:14.920
Here. It's from Mr. Suea OnlyNanno.

13:15.800 --> 13:17.920
This one is specially for you, Headmaster.

13:18.000 --> 13:20.080
And the rest are for the school.

13:20.160 --> 13:21.760
Hello, Mr. Suea.

13:21.840 --> 13:23.400
The headmaster is on the line now.

13:23.480 --> 13:25.240
-Hello, Headmaster.
-Hello.

13:25.320 --> 13:27.600
I'd like to donate something
to the school.

13:27.680 --> 13:29.760
I hope you'll support Nanno,

13:29.840 --> 13:34.360
because her body
should belong to her. Please.

13:34.440 --> 13:35.800
These items?

13:36.400 --> 13:38.760
You can try opening
the computer box first.

13:48.560 --> 13:52.520
Well, maybe I've been
a bit too conservative.

13:52.600 --> 13:55.840
Actually, everyone's body
should belong to themselves.

13:55.920 --> 13:56.880
That's correct.

13:57.600 --> 13:59.760
I'm so happy for you, Blossom.

14:01.040 --> 14:05.520
Your philosophy has now been accepted
by the headmaster.

14:25.680 --> 14:27.560
OnlyNanno is amazing.

14:28.080 --> 14:30.120
I thought
I would have to close the channel.

14:31.000 --> 14:33.160
As a thank-you,

14:33.840 --> 14:36.880
I have a gift for everyone.

14:38.480 --> 14:40.440
Do you want to know what it is?

14:56.680 --> 14:59.400
SO GOOD

14:59.480 --> 15:01.920
BEAUTIFUL BOOBS

15:02.000 --> 15:03.120
SO HOT

15:03.200 --> 15:04.320
SO GOOD

15:04.400 --> 15:06.560
TAKE IT OFF

15:06.640 --> 15:08.480
SO BIG

15:16.480 --> 15:18.480
TAKE IT OFF

15:18.560 --> 15:20.240
BLOSSOM, COME ON

15:20.320 --> 15:24.440
YOU'RE HOT

15:24.520 --> 15:25.520
TONIGHT IS SO GOOD

15:25.600 --> 15:28.840
The beautiful boobs are mine.

15:29.680 --> 15:31.240
BEAUTIFUL BOOBS, BLOSSOM.

15:31.320 --> 15:34.160
I'll dance for you, so they bounce.

15:34.240 --> 15:36.760
TAKE IT OFF

15:36.840 --> 15:39.320
I LIKE WHEN THEY BOUNCE

15:39.400 --> 15:40.440
YES, DANCE

15:40.520 --> 15:41.680
COME CLOSER

15:41.760 --> 15:43.520
BLOSSOM IS THE BEST

15:43.600 --> 15:45.800
BLOSSOM IS COMING TO CLAIM HER THRONE

15:50.320 --> 15:52.120
I think that's too ordinary.

16:13.440 --> 16:15.360
MORE

16:15.440 --> 16:17.680
TAKE OFF YOUR SKIRT

16:17.760 --> 16:19.280
SO HOT

16:19.360 --> 16:21.320
SHE'S THE REAL DEAL

16:31.560 --> 16:33.160
It's so uncomfortable.

16:34.760 --> 16:35.640
Oops.

16:37.120 --> 16:39.480
DANCE MORE

16:39.560 --> 16:41.160
THE BLACK ONE IS HOTTER

16:41.240 --> 16:43.040
I LOVE IT

16:43.120 --> 16:44.120
TEN OUT OF TEN

16:49.360 --> 16:51.040
WHOEVER TAKES IT ALL OFF FIRST WINS

16:51.120 --> 16:52.440
WOW, YOU'RE MAKING ME SWEAT

16:52.520 --> 16:53.400
BLOSSOM IS THE ONE

16:53.480 --> 16:55.280
NANNO ALREADY SHOWED.
WHAT ABOUT YOU, BLOSSOM?

16:57.400 --> 16:59.080
Just taking it off is boring.

17:05.360 --> 17:07.240
I'VE FINISHED

17:07.320 --> 17:08.720
SO HOT

17:08.800 --> 17:10.240
HOTTER THAN BLOSSOM

17:46.640 --> 17:48.160
Thank you, everyone.

17:48.760 --> 17:52.000
Without all of you,
I definitely wouldn't be able to do this.

17:53.000 --> 17:55.360
So I have a gift for everyone.

17:55.920 --> 17:57.240
That is…

17:57.320 --> 17:59.360
a one-day date with Nanno

17:59.440 --> 18:01.240
at a naughty movie theater.

18:02.440 --> 18:03.920
Here are the rules.

18:04.440 --> 18:05.920
I will draw lots,

18:06.000 --> 18:08.760
and the five donors who donate the most

18:08.840 --> 18:10.720
will get the right to draw.

18:11.560 --> 18:12.560
I'VE ALREADY DONATED

18:12.640 --> 18:13.840
I WANT A DATE WITH NANNO

18:14.440 --> 18:15.600
Wow.

18:16.360 --> 18:18.280
Mr. Suea is really going all in.

18:18.360 --> 18:19.880
I'VE DONATED

18:19.960 --> 18:22.160
I can't wait to meet you in person.

18:25.640 --> 18:27.280
Alright then, I will draw the lot now.

18:27.360 --> 18:28.840
SUEA, LEO, ARMKHAEN, WITTAWAT, A-WANG

18:28.920 --> 18:30.400
SUEA, LEO, ARMKHAEN, WITTAWAT, A-WANG

18:30.480 --> 18:31.760
SUEA, LEO, ARMKHAEN, WITTAWAT, A-WANG

18:32.360 --> 18:34.720
And the winner is…

19:30.320 --> 19:31.360
Hop on.

19:31.880 --> 19:32.880
Can I?

19:34.120 --> 19:35.640
Even two of you would still be fine.

19:57.120 --> 19:58.360
Let's take a photo.

20:18.720 --> 20:20.520
What are you planning to do, Nanno?

20:23.040 --> 20:24.880
I didn't even donate.

20:27.720 --> 20:29.120
Nothing.

20:30.640 --> 20:32.080
I just wanted to see you.

20:39.040 --> 20:40.320
So now you know

20:40.840 --> 20:43.320
what's real and what's not?

20:46.320 --> 20:47.680
It's because of you.

20:52.200 --> 20:53.720
Honestly,

20:54.240 --> 20:56.560
no one has ever managed to find me before.

20:58.160 --> 20:59.440
You are the first one.

21:09.480 --> 21:11.160
That's only because you allowed it.

21:13.600 --> 21:14.600
Right?

21:18.880 --> 21:20.600
Who the hell is this Sky?

21:21.520 --> 21:23.200
I've never seen him in the fandom before.

21:28.840 --> 21:31.400
WHO THE HELL IS SKY?
I'VE NEVER SEEN HIM IN THE FANDOM.

21:35.120 --> 21:37.280
SHOULD WE GO GET HIM?

21:37.360 --> 21:38.680
NANNO WON'T LET US SEE HER ANYMORE

21:38.760 --> 21:40.000
BLOSSOM ISN'T SATISFYING ANYMORE

21:43.360 --> 21:44.640
WE NEED TO PROTEST

21:44.720 --> 21:47.160
PROTEST

21:47.760 --> 21:49.200
Everyone,

21:49.280 --> 21:51.920
did you follow what I did today?

21:52.560 --> 21:54.920
I was still thinking
about those who couldn't come,

21:55.440 --> 21:57.000
so I took some photos for you.

21:57.560 --> 21:59.360
I will post them on X for everyone to see.

22:00.600 --> 22:03.800
THE WINNER GOT A REAL DATE WITH ME

22:09.560 --> 22:12.000
Oh? You all don't like them?

22:12.920 --> 22:14.800
I took those photos for you.

22:14.880 --> 22:16.080
FAKE DATE PRIZE

22:16.160 --> 22:17.000
CHEATER

22:17.080 --> 22:18.800
LIAR

22:18.880 --> 22:19.720
Hey.

22:20.640 --> 22:24.160
That's not true. Why would you think that?

22:25.880 --> 22:27.840
But if everyone feels uncomfortable,

22:29.160 --> 22:30.560
I will redo it.

22:30.640 --> 22:31.480
CHEATER

22:31.560 --> 22:33.320
And to apologize…

22:33.400 --> 22:34.640
REDO IT

22:34.720 --> 22:36.120
…it won't just be a date anymore.

22:36.200 --> 22:37.080
YES, THAT WAS CHEATING

22:37.760 --> 22:40.200
It will be a one-night stand with me.

22:44.720 --> 22:48.160
Whoever donates the most
to the education fund will get it.

22:50.520 --> 22:52.600
No more drawing lots.

22:53.560 --> 22:55.880
In three days, I will announce the winner.

22:56.480 --> 22:58.680
Please donate a lot.

23:07.800 --> 23:09.640
BALANCE: 0.75 BAHT

23:25.560 --> 23:26.840
Expel her, Teacher.

23:27.880 --> 23:29.560
I think Nanno has gone too far.

23:30.920 --> 23:33.120
Oh? So our bodies
don't belong to us anymore?

23:34.800 --> 23:36.160
They do.

23:36.240 --> 23:38.320
But this counts as prostitution.

23:38.400 --> 23:41.040
-It's illegal, Teacher.
-No.

23:41.120 --> 23:43.040
If both sides consent,

23:43.120 --> 23:44.560
then it's called consent.

23:45.400 --> 23:48.040
And besides,
Nanno is doing it for charity.

23:48.560 --> 23:50.800
I think you're being too conservative.

24:04.600 --> 24:11.240
JOIN THE EDUCATION FUND DONATION.
TOP DONATOR GETS A NIGHT WITH NANNO.

24:20.920 --> 24:23.120
Hey, come here.

24:23.200 --> 24:24.400
Did you donate?

24:24.920 --> 24:26.440
For Nanno. She's live now.

24:26.520 --> 24:28.120
-Open it now.
-Really?

24:33.240 --> 24:35.120
Suea, why did you go into my room?

24:35.760 --> 24:37.560
Are you going to eat or not?

24:39.400 --> 24:41.240
THE RESULT WILL BE ANNOUNCED IN TWO DAYS

24:48.800 --> 24:50.920
THE RESULT WILL BE ANNOUNCED TOMORROW

25:05.120 --> 25:07.640
TRANSFER COMPLETE
100,000 BAHT

25:35.800 --> 25:37.160
Suea, aren't you going to school?

25:38.560 --> 25:40.080
Yeah, Mom. I'll go soon.

25:40.160 --> 25:41.320
I'M SO EXCITED

25:41.400 --> 25:42.640
I CAN'T WAIT

25:42.720 --> 25:45.120
At this moment,
I would like to take this opportunity

25:45.200 --> 25:50.280
to allow Nanno to use this stage
to declare her bodily freedom.

25:56.840 --> 26:00.400
Thank you to everyone
who made today possible.

26:01.240 --> 26:05.000
I can't believe that my body

26:05.520 --> 26:08.400
could create so many miracles.

26:10.240 --> 26:12.360
But for me to get here today,

26:13.080 --> 26:15.440
there is one person
I must thank above all.

26:16.600 --> 26:18.240
And that person is

26:18.320 --> 26:19.440
Blossom.

26:25.800 --> 26:28.480
If Blossom hadn't inspired me

26:29.000 --> 26:33.440
and said that
our bodies should belong to us,

26:34.200 --> 26:36.640
we probably wouldn't be having
this much fun today.

26:38.640 --> 26:40.720
Thank you very much, Blossom.

26:48.600 --> 26:51.960
All right, let's find out

26:52.480 --> 26:54.520
who donated the most

26:55.080 --> 26:57.280
and will receive

26:58.200 --> 27:00.320
a one-night stand with me.

27:03.160 --> 27:05.360
I won't announce their name.

27:05.880 --> 27:09.240
Instead, I will announce the number.

27:12.640 --> 27:14.560
And the number

27:15.800 --> 27:17.320
is…

27:20.440 --> 27:21.600
one…

27:27.880 --> 27:29.360
zero…

27:33.200 --> 27:34.160
nine.

27:37.560 --> 27:38.720
Damn it!

27:40.280 --> 27:42.560
Number 109.

27:42.640 --> 27:46.240
Meet me at The Royal Resort Park Hotel,

27:47.280 --> 27:50.760
room 205.

27:52.280 --> 27:53.760
At 8:00 p.m.

27:56.880 --> 27:58.760
See you there.

27:58.840 --> 28:00.200
I'll be waiting.

28:08.720 --> 28:10.400
WHO'S 109?

28:10.480 --> 28:11.880
NOT ME

28:12.680 --> 28:15.200
Did she cheat again?

28:15.280 --> 28:17.080
WITH THIS MUCH MONEY,
OF COURSE I WOULDN'T WIN

28:17.160 --> 28:18.840
WHO THE HELL IS HE? HE'S LOADED.

28:34.120 --> 28:39.520
109 GETTING HER ALL TO HIMSELF ISN'T FAIR.
EVERYONE SHOULD GET SOMETHING.

28:47.640 --> 28:48.760
TRUE. WE ALSO DONATED A LOT.

28:48.840 --> 28:50.880
BITCH. GIVE ME MY MONEY BACK.

28:57.080 --> 28:58.000
Where are you going?

28:58.080 --> 28:59.280
You can't go in!

28:59.360 --> 29:02.240
-You can't go in!
-Wait!

29:02.320 --> 29:05.000
-If you're not a guest, you can't go in.
-We are the guests.

29:05.080 --> 29:06.480
Room 205.

29:06.560 --> 29:08.280
-Yeah, that's right.
-Yeah.

29:08.360 --> 29:10.800
-There are too many of you.
-I told you we're the guests.

29:26.000 --> 29:29.240
Damn it. Number 109,
you can't keep Nanno all to yourself.

29:29.320 --> 29:31.360
Damn it. Let me see your face.

29:31.880 --> 29:33.280
-What the hell?
-Shit.

29:43.840 --> 29:46.880
The person who donated the most
to the education fund

29:48.480 --> 29:52.160
will get a one-night stand with me.

29:53.040 --> 29:55.240
274,600 BAHT
CONFIRM TRANSACTION

29:58.640 --> 30:00.800
Number 109.

30:04.800 --> 30:06.680
You used your money
to do something like this?

30:06.760 --> 30:07.880
Get down here!

30:07.960 --> 30:10.000
Drag him down! Beat him up!

30:18.480 --> 30:21.560
Calm down. What's going on here?

30:23.480 --> 30:25.120
She's telling us to calm down.

30:28.120 --> 30:30.200
How the hell are we supposed to stay calm?

30:30.720 --> 30:33.160
We spent so much money on you.

30:33.760 --> 30:35.520
And we didn't get anything at all.

30:36.400 --> 30:38.640
But everything went
according to the rules.

30:39.160 --> 30:40.960
What rules?

30:43.000 --> 30:46.480
Me and the OnlyNanno fans,

30:47.000 --> 30:48.440
we paid you so much money.

30:48.520 --> 30:52.280
But that old bastard lying over there
gets you all to himself.

30:52.880 --> 30:54.320
That's not fair.

30:55.360 --> 30:57.160
Your body,

30:58.200 --> 30:59.680
everything that belongs to you,

30:59.760 --> 31:01.440
should belong to us too.

31:01.520 --> 31:02.600
Oh?

31:03.480 --> 31:05.440
Didn't everyone support the idea that

31:05.960 --> 31:10.400
my body belongs to me?

31:14.760 --> 31:16.160
It's your body,

31:17.440 --> 31:19.080
but it's my money.

31:28.200 --> 31:30.320
Then what should we do to make it fair?

31:33.120 --> 31:35.920
Should I divide myself
into pieces for everyone?

31:40.200 --> 31:41.520
Then come and take it.

32:03.840 --> 32:07.400
My body, my choice, Blossom.

32:40.720 --> 32:42.880
Welcome back to my channel.

32:45.880 --> 32:47.400
Just like I said,

32:50.680 --> 32:54.920
our bodies belong to us.

32:57.640 --> 32:58.720
So…

34:02.400 --> 34:05.040
We have to stop the opening
of the Hundred-Year Building.

34:05.760 --> 34:08.200
Your group wants to expose
the building corruption, right?

34:08.280 --> 34:09.560
I'll help you.

34:12.200 --> 34:14.600
Nanno, whose side are you really on? 

34:16.480 --> 34:19.000
Don't disappoint me.

34:20.560 --> 34:21.720
Shit.

34:26.080 --> 34:28.800
If the Exclamation group
releases this clip,

34:28.880 --> 34:30.880
they're dead.

34:33.760 --> 34:35.440
The Exclamation group
still hasn't given up?

34:36.040 --> 34:37.360
Hide the truth.

34:38.680 --> 34:40.440
-Shit.
-Distract.

34:41.440 --> 34:43.960
That's the art
of those who control the game.

34:44.040 --> 34:45.240
Checkmate.

34:47.800 --> 34:49.640
This time,
they're definitely going to die.

36:44.360 --> 36:49.360
Subtitle translation by: Panuwat Baikeawon
